NAME
       touch - change file timestamps or create empty files

SYNOPSIS
       touch [-acm] file ...

DESCRIPTION
       Sets the timestamps of each FILE to the current time, creating
       the file empty if it does not exist.

OPTIONS
       -a     change the access time only (accepted; Cervus keeps no
              access time, so this has no effect)
       -c     do not create files that do not exist
       -m     change the modification time only

SEE ALSO
       stat(1)
